# Scenario: a mall shop unit that escapes to the concourse at the front or the service corridor at the back.
evacuation "Unit 14 escape plan" unit m
compliance iso
sheet a3 landscape
room mall "Mall Concourse" at 0,0 size 17x3
room shop "Shop Floor" at 0,3 size 10x8
room fitting "Fitting Rooms" at 10,3 size 4x4
room stock "Stockroom" at 10,7 size 4x4
room staff "Staff Room" at 14,3 size 3x8
room service "Service Corridor" at 0,11 size 17x2
opening between shop mall at 50% width 4
door between shop fitting at 50% width 0.9
door between shop stock at 50% width 1.2
door between stock staff at 50% width 0.9
door between stock service at 50% width 1.2
here in shop at 5,6 "YOU ARE HERE"
exit-final xMall in mall at 0,1.5 side west "EXIT"
exit-final xService in service at 17,1 side east "EXIT"
extinguisher f1 in stock at 3.5,0.5 class "ABC"
assembly car outside at 22,16 "ASSEMBLY POINT"
route primary here -> mall -> xMall
route secondary here -> stock -> service -> xService
legend auto
